  "title": "CORMEDIX THERAPEUTICS ANNOUNCES POSITIVE TOPLINE RESULTS FROM PHASE III RESPECT TRIAL ASSESSING REZZAYO® FOR THE PROPHYLAXIS OF INVASIVE FUNGAL DISEASES IN ALLOGENEIC HEMATOPOIETIC STEM CELL TRANSPLANTATION PATIENTS",
